BOUNDS

 FR LRW8A     'DEFAULT'

START POINT

 XV LRW8A     'DEFAULT' 1.0

GROUP TYPE

 GV LOGREG    W
 GP LOGREG    P1
 GP LOGREG    P2

 GV REG       X
 GP REG       W

GROUP USES

 DO I         1                        M
 XT L(I)      LOGREG
 A- P1        Y(I)                     LOWER
 R/ P1        P1                       SCALE
 A- P2        UPPER                    Y(I)
 R/ P2        P2                       SCALE
 ZP L(I)      P1                       P1
 ZP L(I)      P2                       P2
 ND

 DO I         1                        N
 XT R(I)      REG
 ZP R(I)      W                        SIGMA
 ND

OBJECT BOUND

 LO LRW8A                1.0

*   Solution

*LO SOLTN               1.0

ENDATA

*********************
* SET UP THE GROUPS *
* ROUTINE           *
*********************

GROUPS        LRW8A

TEMPORARIES

 R  P
 R  EW
 R  U
 R  R
 R  F
 R  G
 R  H
 R  LOGU
 M  EXP
 M  LOG
 L  WGE0

INDIVIDUALS

*   logreg2 = w1 * log u + w2 * ( w + log u )
*   where u = 1 + exp(-w) 

 T  LOGREG
 A  P                   P1 + P2 
 A  WGE0                W .GE. 0.0
 I  WGE0      EW        EXP( - W )
 E  WGE0      EW        EXP( W )
 A  U                   1.0 + EW
 A  R                   EW / U
 A  LOGU                LOG( U )
 I  WGE0      F         P * LOGU + P2 * W
 I  WGE0      G         - P * R + P2
 I  WGE0      H         P * ( R - R ** 2 )
 E  WGE0      F          - P * ( W - LOGU ) + P2 * W
 E  WGE0      G          - P * ( 1.0 - R ) + P2
 E  WGE0      H         P * ( R - R ** 2 )
 F                      F
 G                      G
 H                      H

*  reg = w x^2 / ( 1 + x^2 )

 T  REG
 A  U                   1.0 + X ** 2
 F                      W * X ** 2 / U
 G                      W * 2.0 * X / U ** 2
 H                      W * 2.0 * ( 1 - 3.0 * X ** 2 ) / U ** 3

ENDATA
